   "MatterHistoryActionId": 372,
   "MatterHistoryActionName": "passed on first reading",
   "MatterHistoryActionText": "Council Member Horton moved to suspend the rules of procedure to introduce a late filed bill. Without objection, Council Member Horton moved that the bill be passed on first reading, which motion was seconded and approved by a voice vote of the Council, with Council Member Styles voting No and Council Members Allen and Webb abstaining. The bill is referred to the Planning and Zoning Committee and the Transportation and Infrastructure Committee",
